"Working-with-nodes/Understanding-ROS2-Nodes/Understanding-ROS2-Nodes>` and :"
"doc:`topics <../../../topics/Understanding-ROS2-Topics/Understanding-ROS2-"
"Topics>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/services/Working-with-services/Understanding-ROS2-Services/Understanding-ROS2-Services.rst:49
msgid ""
