msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/services/Working-with-services/Understanding-ROS2-Services/Understanding-ROS2-Services.rst:303
msgid ""
"Before you call a service with arguments, inspect its type so you know which "
"fields the request needs and what the response contains."
msgstr ""

